Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|testray.main.component.name|Plugin Installer|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
	When Page add
		|pageName|Test Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: Mail Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|portlet.plugins.includes|mail-portlet|
	When these variables
		|appName|Mail|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Mail|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|App Manager|
	And AppManager uninstall App CP
		|appName|${appName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|App Manager|
	Then AppManager view Uninstall App CP
		|appName|${appName}|